# No fix available upstream yet
# Affects: syft/trivy gobinaries, not application code
# Review: when syft/trivy release updated builds
CVE-2025-61726
# .trivyignore
# CVE-2026-27903. CVE-2026-27904 - minimatch HIGH
# False positive: Trivy flags ^10.2.1 range in @eslint/config-array
# Resolved version in lockfile and node_modules: 10.2.3 (patched)
# Verified: npm ls minimatch shows 10.2.3 everywhere
# Date: 2026-03-01
CVE-2026-27904
CVE-2026-27903
# CVE-2026-24051 - HIGH otel/sdk v1.39.0 in syft v1.42.1
# Fix available in otel v1.40.0 but syft has not updated dependency yet
# Affects: syft gobinary only, not application code
# Remove when syft releases with otel >= v1.40.0
# Date: 2026-03-01
CVE-2026-24051
# CVE-2026-29786 - HIGH in internal npm dependency (node-tar)
# This affects the global npm binary, not the application itself.
# Application code uses tar v7.5.10 (verified in package-lock.json).
CVE-2026-29786

# CVE-2025-15558 - HIGH in Trivy gobinary (docker/cli)
